            <title>[MAHOUT-1313] RowSimilarityJob, sampleDown method problem</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1313</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;RowSimilarityJob.java , sampleDown method &lt;br/&gt;
----line 291 or 300&lt;br/&gt;
 double rowSampleRate = Math.min(maxObservationsPerRow, observationsPerRow) / observationsPerRow;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;currently always return either 0.0 or 1.0.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Should return true double, eg: 0.34,... &lt;/p&gt;</description>
